's the biology you want to  model what's the best way to  assemble that system and how do you best  you implement that and really we walk  through that kind of uh  strategy uh routinely uh and  uh you know obviously how complex you  want to make it how complex are you able  to make it it certainly  comes in and plays a key role but  ultimately  i think our goal is to start to assemble  these multiple different tissue types to  capture more and more of the whole body  physiology and with that i very much  appreciate your time  and i would love to answer or entertain  and answer  any of your questions thank you
 

